---@field container? string The uploaded video file's container format.
---@field durationMs? string The length of the uploaded video in milliseconds.
---@field fileSize? string The uploaded file's size in bytes. This field is present whether a video file or another type of file was uploaded.
---@field fileType? gcp.youtube_v3.VideoFileDetailsFileTypeEnum|string The uploaded file's type as detected by YouTube's video processing engine. Currently, YouTube only processes video files, but this field is present whether a video file or another type of file was uploaded.

